The DNG ZIP decoder statically links LibRaw 0.21.4, which is available under
the LGPL-2.1-or-later or CDDL-1.0. The corresponding license text, notices,
and source offer must accompany distributed binaries. The source is available
at https://github.com/LibRaw/LibRaw tag 0.21.4; this repository's build script
also builds it with the LibRaw-cmake scripts and the Android NDK sysroot zlib.
